    {
      "title": "v2.7.0",
      "updated": "2025-07-26T11:59:17Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/tag/v2.7.0",
      "notes_html": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Ability to remove <code>workers</code> from the UI(mostly needed for docker installs). <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3225139114\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/460\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/460/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/460\">#460</a></li>\n<li>Support of <code>LDAP</code> as a user backend. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3204010745\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/454\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/454/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/454\">#454</a></li>\n<li>Ability to disable <code>User Settings</code>. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3246289610\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/466\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/466/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/466\">#466</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>ComfyUI and Comfy-Manager updated to the latest versions. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3265379279\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/469\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/469/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/469\">#469</a></li>\n</ul>",
