    {
      "title": "v2.6.0",
      "updated": "2025-07-13T11:52:35Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/tag/v2.6.0",
      "notes_html": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>New flows: <code>Flux Kontext</code> and <code>Restore Old Photo</code>.</li>\n<li>Docker Compose: ability to specify CUDA version. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3175191483\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/441\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/441/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/441\">#441</a> Thanks to <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/julienym/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/julienym\">@julienym</a></li>\n<li>Pre-init ComfyUI engine settings from the database. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3165029941\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/436\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/436/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/436\">#436</a></li>\n<li>New <strong>sync</strong> endpoint to create task and receive a result(<em>for the upcoming MCP</em>). <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3181328953\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/442\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/442/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/442\">#442</a></li>\n<li>Added <code>gemma-3-12b-it</code> and <code>gemma-3-27b-it</code> models. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3185886376\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/448\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/448/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/448\">#448</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Flow <code>SDXL Ghibli</code> was replaced with flow <code>Ghibli (Flux Kontext)</code>.</li>\n<li>Replaced <code>gemini-1.5-flash-002</code> and <code>gemini-1.5-pro-002</code> with <code>gemini-2.5-flash</code> and <code>gemini-2.5-pro</code>. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3164878153\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/435\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/435/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/435\">#435</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>UI: \"Reset params button\" - detection of default value of the <code>Aspect Ratio</code> parameter. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3165841178\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/437\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/437/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/437\">#437</a></li>\n<li>UI: correct displaying results of hidden tasks(like <code>Ask AI</code>). <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3184925314\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/445\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/445/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/445\">#445</a></li>\n<li>Correctly rewire existing optional input param when disconnecting optional input node form graph. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3181643640\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/443\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/443/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/443\">#443</a></li>\n<li>Update process: restart the process after installing the new basic python packages for ComfyUI. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3183133807\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/444\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/444/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/444\">#444</a></li>\n<li>Docker image for AMD: do not run multiple workers to prevent running worker on APU.</li>\n<li>Adding <code>LoRAs</code> to the flows in new clean installations. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3185871782\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/447\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/447/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/447\">#447</a></li>\n<li>Update process between the release versions. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3191239800\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/452\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/452/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/452\">#452</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "assets": [
        "/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/download/v2.6.0/vix_portable_cuda.7z"
      ],
      "assets_source": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/expanded_assets/v2.6.0"
