    {
      "title": "v2.5.1",
      "updated": "2025-06-06T08:14:04Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/tag/v2.5.1",
      "notes_html": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Docker(CUDA): from now Visionatrix will use all available GPUs by default. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3110730028\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/427\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/427/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/427\">#427</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Windows: fix broken <code>filterpy</code> package which leads to errors in many flows. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3106660654\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/426\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/426/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/426\">#426</a></li>\n<li>SettingsUI(Workers): correctly display <code>Smart Memory</code>, <code>VRAM State</code>,.. details. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3115000711\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/429\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/429/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/429\">#429</a></li>\n<li>SettingsUI(Comfy): <code>Show ComfyUI folders</code> button now works even when you did not set custom path to models. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3118503604\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/430\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/430/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/430\">#430</a></li>\n<li>NPM packages update. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3105243006\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/424\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/424/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/424\">#424</a></li>\n<li>Security issue. Big thanks to <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/protozeit/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/protozeit\">@protozeit</a> for reporting it.</li>\n</ul>",
      "assets": [
        "/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/download/v2.5.1/vix_portable_cuda.7z"
      ],
      "assets_source": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/expanded_assets/v2.5.1"
    },
    {
      "title": "v2.5.0",
      "updated": "2025-05-30T07:08:28Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/tag/v2.5.0",
      "notes_html": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Option to set <code>reserve-vram</code> parameter for Workers from UI. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3097909075\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/421\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/421/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/421\">#421</a></li>\n<li>Ability to override <code>smart-memory</code>, <code>vae_cpu</code>, <code>reserve-vram</code>, <code>cache-type</code> for specific workers from UI. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3092665011\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/420\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/420/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/420\">#420</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Default model for LLM and VLM now is <code>gemma3:12b-it-qat</code> instead of <code>qwen2.5:14b</code>. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3088409935\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/414\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/414/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/414\">#414</a></li>\n<li><code>ComfyUI_FizzNodes</code> node pack was dropped from the basic node list, as abandoned. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3088570980\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/415\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/415/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/415\">#415</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Federation and Global Worker Settings are hidden from non-admin users. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3077845051\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/411\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/411/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/411\">#411</a></li>\n<li>Gemini node is now used with GOOGLE_API_KEY environment variable and did not get saved in the workflow. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3089222659\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/418\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/418/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/418\">#418</a></li>\n<li>ComfyUI required packages now prioritized by ComfyUI-Manager to not break ComfyUI`s dependencies. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3089113784\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/417\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/417/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/417\">#417</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "assets": [
        "/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/download/v2.5.0/vix_portable_cuda.7z"
      ],
      "assets_source": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/expanded_assets/v2.5.0"
