    {
      "title": "v2.4.1",
      "updated": "2025-05-18T13:07:18Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/releases/tag/v2.4.1",
      "notes_html": "<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>UI option to enable processing <code>VAE</code> on the CPU, located in the <strong>Settings -&gt; Workers</strong> page. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3071588654\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/408\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/408/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/408\">#408</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>Smart Memory</code> is enabled by default (like it was before <code>2.4.0</code> version). <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3071482351\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/issues/407\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/407/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/Visionatrix/Visionatrix/pull/407\">#407</a></li>\n</ul>",
